## Files in this folder

| File                                          | Purpose                                                       |
| :-------------------------------------------- | :------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `{{BASE_NAME}}_part_NNN_of_{{CHUNK_COUNT}}__lines_S-E.txt` | The {{CHUNK_COUNT}} byte-exact chunks (UTF-8, LF-aligned)    |
| `INDEX.csv`                                   | Machine-readable index — see schema below                     |
| `INSTRUCTIONS.md`                             | This file                                                     |

`INDEX.csv` columns:

```text
Part,FileName,StartLine,EndLine,LineCount,StartByte,EndByte,ByteSize
```

- `StartLine` / `EndLine` are 1-based, inclusive, in the **original**
  `{{SOURCE_FILENAME}}`.
- `StartByte` / `EndByte` are 0-based, inclusive, in the **original** file.
- `ByteSize = EndByte - StartByte + 1`.

